  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Emergency Agricultural Productivity Support Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to increase smallholder productivity of targeted commodities in the intervention areas.  The commodities targeted are rice, maize, cassava and traditional poultry.</narrative>
  </description>
